.SH NAME
NM860 - Displays symbol table information for iPSC\*R/860\fR\fR\fR\fR\& object files. 
.\" End Summary
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
\&\fBnm860\fR\fR\& [ \fR\fIoptions\fI\fR\& ] \fR\fIfilename\fI\fR\
\& ... 
.SH ARGUMENTS 
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fR\fIfilename\fI\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' The name of the iPSC/860\& object file or library. 
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.LP
You may specify the following \fR\fIoptions\fI\fR\& in any order:
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-o\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Display numbers in octal.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-x\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Display numbers in hexadecimal.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-d\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Display numbers in decimal.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-h \fR\fR	\h'-\w' 'u' Suppress headers.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-v\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Sort symbols by value.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-n\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Sort symbols by name.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-e\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Display external relocatable symbols only.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-f\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Display all symbols, including redundant symbols. Overrides \fB\
\&-e\fR\fR\&.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-u\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Display a list of undefined symbols.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-r\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Prepend the current file name to symbols.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-p\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Use short form output. (See ``Description'' section.) 
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-T\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Truncate symbol names to 19 characters, plus an asterisk to indicate truncation.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-V\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Display the tool banner (tool name, version, etc.).
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.SH DESCRIPTION
.LP
Use \fBnm860\fR\fR\& to display the symbol tables of the named file(s). 
.LP
For each symbol in the output of the \fB\&-p\fR\fR\& option, one of the following characters identifies its type:
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
t 	\h'-\w' 'u' Text section symbol
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
d 	\h'-\w' 'u' Data section symbol
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
b 	\h'-\w' 'u' BSS section symbol
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
f 	\h'-\w' 'u' File tag
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
c 	\h'-\w' 'u' Common symbol
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
a 	\h'-\w' 'u' Absolute
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
u 	\h'-\w' 'u' Undefined
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
r 	\h'-\w' 'u' Register symbol
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
s 	\h'-\w' 'u' Other symbol
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.LP
In addition, local symbols appear in lowercase and external symbols appear in uppercase.
.LP
When using the \fB\&-v\fR\fR\& or \fB\&-n\fR\fR\& options (sort by value or name, respectively), the scoping information is \
jumbled, so it is advisable to use the \fB\&-e\fR\fR\& (externals only) option.
